      [38;5;220m│[39m  [38;5;240m── Limits ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[39m  [38;5;220m│[39m
      [38;5;220m│[39m  Management covers direct children in this project. Wider-egress children are read-only.                 [38;5;220m│[39m
